abstract: "A formal framework in which the pre-boundary is structurally silent and reality begins at a constraint-release event. Two-Realm Register: working realm of executed tests (W1–W7, bank 8/0) and reverence realm of permanent silences (S1–S4). Includes the aligned protocol (E0–E5), the unified register, the W4b chiral direction channel, the W5 common-operator result, and the machine-readable W4c F3 S→W migration gate. Model-level claims with executed numerical protocols; no empirical cosmological claim is made."
